Applications of Data Mining:
•	Marketing: Customer segmentation, targeted marketing campaigns.
•	Finance: Credit scoring, fraud detection, algorithmic trading.
•	Healthcare: Disease prediction, patient clustering, drug discovery.
•	Retail: Inventory management, demand forecasting, recommendation systems.
•	Manufacturing: Predictive maintenance, quality control.
•	Telecommunications: Churn prediction, network optimization.
Tools and Techniques:
